{#
    The three card fields, drawn the way the theme draws any form: a label above each, and an empty
    element the gateway's script fills with its frame. The frame copies the look of a `form-control`
    placed in that element for a moment — height, border, radius, font, colours — which is why there
    is no stylesheet here: the theme's own inputs are the source, and a theme that changes them
    changes these.

    The title is the frame's accessible name and the placeholder is what a shopper sees before
    typing. Both are read by the script off these elements, so they are translated here rather than
    in JavaScript. The ids are what the script hands the gateway as selectors; a store that overrides
    this file and drops them gets ids from the script.
#}
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-8 col-lg-6">
        <div class="mb-3">
            <label class="form-label">{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.card_number'|trans }}</label>
            <div
                id="nmi-card-number"
                data-nmi-field="ccnumber"
                data-nmi-title="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.card_number'|trans }}"
                data-nmi-placeholder="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.card_number_placeholder'|trans }}"
                {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('nmi-card-number') }}
            ></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-6 mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.expiry'|trans }}</label>
                <div
                    id="nmi-card-expiry"
                    data-nmi-field="ccexp"
                    data-nmi-title="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.expiry'|trans }}"
                    data-nmi-placeholder="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.expiry_placeholder'|trans }}"
                    {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('nmi-card-expiry') }}
                ></div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.security_code'|trans }}</label>
                <div
                    id="nmi-card-cvv"
                    data-nmi-field="cvv"
                    data-nmi-title="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.security_code'|trans }}"
                    data-nmi-placeholder="{{ 'jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.security_code_placeholder'|trans }}"
                    {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('nmi-card-cvv') }}
                ></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {#
            Where an attempt that went nowhere is said out loud: a field left empty, frames that
            did not answer, an authentication that failed. Hidden until there is something to say.
        #}
        <p data-nmi-error class="text-danger" role="alert" hidden {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('nmi-card-error') }}></p>
    </div>
</div>
